; Organism by default of this MiraMon user. This section is created by
; MiraMon setup program (Inst_MM9.exe in MiraMon version 9). You can get
; a detailed description about the keys describing an organism in the MiraMon 
; manual
;==========================================================================

;IndividualName=
;PositionName=
;OrganisationName=CREAF
;n_onlineResource=2

